# Midnight Snack (CR 603.4, 508.1, 111.10b): "Raid — At the beginning of your end step, if you attacked this turn, create a Food
# token." Black Lotus pays for it on turn 1; nothing attacked that turn (the Memnite is summoning-sick), so no Food. On turn 3
# the Memnite attacks and the end step makes one Food token; on turn 5 nothing attacks and there is no second.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Memnite
Midnight Snack
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Midnight Snack.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield = Memnite; Midnight Snack
Bot1.Attack(Memnite > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield = Food Token; Memnite; Midnight Snack
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield = Food Token; Memnite; Midnight Snack
? Bot2.Life = 19

[Expect]
Turn = 7
